<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese money supply rises 9 pct yr/yr Dec '96.</title>
<headline>Portuguese money supply rises 9 pct yr/yr Dec '96.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese money supply, as measured by &quot;aggregate 'L&quot;, roughly equivalent to M3, rose 9.0 percent year-on-year in December 1996, compared with 8.2 percent year-on-year in December 1995, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
</text>
